            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, qUESTION: And on that, do we look at the whole State and what would happen overall, or do we just focus on individual legislative senatorial districts?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice (question)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1f38f221fe87c9c3bffdfe6e0148ceaa3b4c2edbb25d4b4b870852f3dd79643f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1f38f221fe87-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice (question), according to Justice (question), qUESTION: May I ask a sort of a general question? In any of the analysis, do the judges take into account the likelihood of winning primaries as opposed to the likelihood of winning the election itself?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1f38f221fe87c9c3bffdfe6e0148ceaa3b4c2edbb25d4b4b870852f3dd79643f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1f38f221fe87-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, qUESTION: Now, worse off, I thought -- and I'm still at my same problem of what am I supposed to do in this case. But I thought worse off means their right to vote is abridged because of race. Abridged is the word."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1f38f221fe87c9c3bffdfe6e0148ceaa3b4c2edbb25d4b4b870852f3dd79643f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1f38f221fe87-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, qUESTION: So what -- what do I read and what pages do I read?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1f38f221fe87c9c3bffdfe6e0148ceaa3b4c2edbb25d4b4b870852f3dd79643f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1f38f221fe87-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, qUESTION: The district court didn't consider that relevant testimony because it was not testimony about safe seats elsewhere."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1f38f221fe87c9c3bffdfe6e0148ceaa3b4c2edbb25d4b4b870852f3dd79643f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1f38f221fe87-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, qUESTION: That's what we're supposed to, go into which political party is better for which particular group of people?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1f38f221fe87c9c3bffdfe6e0148ceaa3b4c2edbb25d4b4b870852f3dd79643f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1f38f221fe87-0003-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, qUESTION: May I ask before -- before you conclude your argument, what is the status of the litigation that's pending in the State court to resolve the dispute between the Attorney General and the Governor?"
      }
    ],
